1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,970
Priya: Rosa. Take off the glove.

2
00:00:02,290 --> 00:00:06,469
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part nine of ten: the glove.

3
00:00:06,789 --> 00:00:12,643
Rosa: Seven-fifty. The garage. I counted.
Ten hours.

4
00:00:12,963 --> 00:00:15,219
Dante: I knew it! I knew it!

5
00:00:15,339 --> 00:00:16,039
Marcus: Rosa?!

6
00:00:16,359 --> 00:00:17,648
Priya: Why didn't you tell us?

7
00:00:17,768 --> 00:00:22,578
Rosa: You'd have put me off at the first
stop. And then, who drives?

8
00:00:22,898 --> 00:00:25,047
Dante: She's infected! We leave her here!

9
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:29,614
Marcus: She drove us through a tunnel and
a toll, with a fever. I'm not leaving her.

10
00:00:29,934 --> 00:00:31,299
June: Sit down, Dante.

11
00:00:31,419 --> 00:00:32,921
Mr. Park: She could have left us anywhere.

12
00:00:33,241 --> 00:00:35,120
Benny: Cluck... I mean, she stays.

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,053
Amara: Please.

14
00:00:36,373 --> 00:00:38,967
Teddy: Rosa, you can't turn. Gary won't
allow it.

15
00:00:39,287 --> 00:00:42,336
Priya: Everyone who wants Rosa to stay.
Hands up.

16
00:00:42,456 --> 00:00:43,115
Dante: ...Fine.

17
00:00:43,435 --> 00:00:47,477
Rosa: Thirty-eight minutes. I need a
driver for the last mile. Marcus.

18
00:00:47,797 --> 00:00:48,538
Marcus: I can't.

19
00:00:48,658 --> 00:00:50,972
Rosa: You climbed a bridge for a dinosaur.

20
00:00:51,092 --> 00:00:51,982
Teddy: Gary says yes.

21
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:54,913
BUS-E: Rosa. I will keep the dome light on
for you.

22
00:00:55,233 --> 00:01:00,037
BUS-E: Part nine of ten, The Last Bus.
Next: Pier 8. Follow for the final part.

